OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor wants action over
OL,4,A'depressing' grades
OL,5,
OL,6,FA politician has called for action to
OL,7,Fdeal with poor exam performance in an
OL,8,Farea where GCSE results were the worst
OL,9,Fin the region.
OL,11,FKathryn Woodfine, an independent
OL,12,FCentral Bedfordshire councillor, has
OL,13,Fdescribed this year's results as
OL,14,F"depressing and worrying".
OL,16,FFigures showed performance at GCSE in
OL,17,FCentral Bedfordshire was below the
OL,18,Fnational average.
OL,20,FThe council said average grades in
OL,21,Feight key subjects were almost 2%
OL,22,Fhigher than in 2025.
